		(at 124.95 100.9 180)
		(descr "Molex 85508-5001 Cat5e modular jack, top entry, 8P8C THT, shielded. Pattern from SD-85508-501 rev J: 8 signal holes 0.90 (rows 2.54 apart, 1.27 stagger, 8.89 span), pegs 3.25 at 11.43, shield holes 1.60 at 15.6, 3.05 behind pegs. On this board the four jacks butt at 16.6 pitch, so adjacent shield tabs share a plated slot between jacks and the two outermost tabs are clipped at assembly. Body 16.6 x 17.3.")
